    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist the full game</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Battle against massive hordes of zombies, acquire experience to level up and make strategic choices to become stronger than your enemies. Heavily inspired by great rogue-likes such as Vampire Survivors, Magic Survival and Risk of Rain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/e2dc66949508b00f417f1799bc638958.poster.avif?t=1661264035\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/e2dc66949508b00f417f1799bc638958.webm?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/e2dc66949508b00f417f1799bc638958.mp4?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boss Fights</h2>At the end of every level you will encounter a boss with their own unique mechanics.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/c2806fe047199f15507abe9f9fd39c7e.poster.avif?t=1661264035\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/c2806fe047199f15507abe9f9fd39c7e.webm?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/c2806fe047199f15507abe9f9fd39c7e.mp4?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Super Powerups</h2>Explore the city, and if you\u2019re lucky you might find super powerups! <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/bb9158ce6df48500448513c5969e2827.poster.avif?t=1661264035\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/bb9158ce6df48500448513c5969e2827.webm?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/bb9158ce6df48500448513c5969e2827.mp4?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Active Skills</h2>Unlock active skills that fit your unique playstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features (More content in full version)</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unlock and upgrade characters, weapons and skills<br></li><li> Complete challenges to unlock certain items<br></li><li> Events<br></li><li> Active skill system<br></li><li> 16+ Weapons<br></li><li> 35+ Powerups<br></li><li> 1 Large map<br></li><li> 1 Boss</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/1254cf4086c0b1df369b07c653de5e27.avif?t=1661264035\" /></div><br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "Battle against massive hordes of zombies, acquire experience to level up and make strategic choices to become stronger than your enemies. Heavily inspired by great rogue-likes such as Vampire Survivors, Magic Survival and Risk of Rain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/e2dc66949508b00f417f1799bc638958.poster.avif?t=1661264035\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/e2dc66949508b00f417f1799bc638958.webm?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/e2dc66949508b00f417f1799bc638958.mp4?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boss Fights</h2>At the end of every level you will encounter a boss with their own unique mechanics.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/c2806fe047199f15507abe9f9fd39c7e.poster.avif?t=1661264035\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/c2806fe047199f15507abe9f9fd39c7e.webm?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/c2806fe047199f15507abe9f9fd39c7e.mp4?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Super Powerups</h2>Explore the city, and if you\u2019re lucky you might find super powerups! <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/bb9158ce6df48500448513c5969e2827.poster.avif?t=1661264035\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/bb9158ce6df48500448513c5969e2827.webm?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/bb9158ce6df48500448513c5969e2827.mp4?t=1661264035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Active Skills</h2>Unlock active skills that fit your unique playstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features (More content in full version)</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unlock and upgrade characters, weapons and skills<br></li><li> Complete challenges to unlock certain items<br></li><li> Events<br></li><li> Active skill system<br></li><li> 16+ Weapons<br></li><li> 35+ Powerups<br></li><li> 1 Large map<br></li><li> 1 Boss</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811430/extras/1254cf4086c0b1df369b07c653de5e27.avif?t=1661264035\" /></div><br><br>",
